    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buttons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192\uff0cZ\uff08enter or controller A\uff09\uff0cX\uff08esc or controller B\uff09, Menu called out by the controller: Y</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil king, having just depleted his power, suddenly became the target of everyone's ire in the entire world!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hero, hero, hero, Devil King, hero, hero, hero.&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to vanquish the Devil King, countless brave warriors rushed towards the Devil King's castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep going and keep living... Lord Devil King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and prepare for battle in seven-day cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless battle, but depending on the number of rounds held, retiring can reveal multiple different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only operate and make decisions within the scope of the Devil King Castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen types of heroes will be randomly paired into four-person teams, potentially resulting in thousands of hero combinations?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 types of subordinates, and 4 of them can be dispatched randomly each round, bringing different disturbances to the hero team.\u00a0If the same subordinate appears multiple times .....</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills(118 types) and equipment(300+ types) obtainable in each round are all contained in the random pool. Will the encounter with the hero be easy or challenging?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way, there are also mysterious enemies While luck favors you, use tactics to defeat them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you suddenly have bad luck after a few rounds and don't want to lose the current round, mysterious code: 99519951. Once you enter the game, you will know where it is used, Lord Devil King.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buttons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191\u2193\u2190\u2192\uff0cZ\uff08enter or controller A\uff09\uff0cX\uff08esc or controller B\uff09, Menu called out by the controller: Y</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil king, having just depleted his power, suddenly became the target of everyone's ire in the entire world!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hero, hero, hero, Devil King, hero, hero, hero.&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to vanquish the Devil King, countless brave warriors rushed towards the Devil King's castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep going and keep living... Lord Devil King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and prepare for battle in seven-day cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless battle, but depending on the number of rounds held, retiring can reveal multiple different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only operate and make decisions within the scope of the Devil King Castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eighteen types of heroes will be randomly paired into four-person teams, potentially resulting in thousands of hero combinations?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 types of subordinates, and 4 of them can be dispatched randomly each round, bringing different disturbances to the hero team.\u00a0If the same subordinate appears multiple times .....</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills(118 types) and equipment(300+ types) obtainable in each round are all contained in the random pool. Will the encounter with the hero be easy or challenging?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way, there are also mysterious enemies While luck favors you, use tactics to defeat them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you suddenly have bad luck after a few rounds and don't want to lose the current round, mysterious code: 99519951. Once you enter the game, you will know where it is used, Lord Devil King.</p>",
    "short_description": "Players will play as the Devil King, with a cycle of seven days, learning skills, searching for treasures, interfering with heroes, setting traps, and surviving under the continuous attacks of heroes.",
